From 45c31c77e7e83efa06653737dbf0636f88c89082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Redgrave961 <214504937+Redgrave961@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:11:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] toolkit: firmware-accurate NetCtl, memory map, user memory
 size and cellOvis

- cellNetCtl: offline GetState reports Disconnected with CELL_OK and GetInfo
  returns NOT_CONNECTED (except the ethernet address), as lv2 does.
- vm.h: move the HLE heap, audio and sys_vm windows to 0xA0000000+, so title
  reservations land at 0x40000000/0x50000000 like on hardware.
- syscall 352 returns the real sys_memory_get_user_memory_size accounting.
- sys_memory: log mmapper reservations, shared memory and every ENOMEM with
  the guest call chain.
- cellOvis: the real two-function API (GetOverlayTableSize and
  InitializeOverlayTable) with its error codes; overlay ELFs are validated.
---
